[Verse]
The dif[A]ference between the [G]right and wrong
The [A]limits I should [G]not go beyond
My[A]self at [G]all

[Chorus]
score: 03-Bones-Bones-Chorus-1.svg
grid: | Cmaj7 | Am9 | Cmaj7 | %% |
grid: | Cmaj7 | D | E B E B | E B E B |
