Now I can feel it in my bones,
I really know where I belong
With my naked soul in front of all,
I know where I went wrong

[Verse]
For sure I mistook
The empty places for a royal court
And my small steps for great endeavours
And I just confused my mess with the complex
Smothered by the tides of my pride

[Chorus]
Now I can feel it in my bones,
Have to confess I lost control
Now my body is lost for good for all
But I know where I went wrong (x2)

[Solo]
Now I can feel it in my bones,
This holy fire burns my soul!
Pulverized by some unknown forces,
